      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule 1   Both governed workspaces:  allow Lakehouse, Data pipeline, Notebook\nRule 2   Data Engineering + AI:  allow Data agent\nRule 3   Every workspace EXCEPT the two governed workspaces:  allow all item types\n\nAn item can be created if ANY rule allows it. Anything no rule allows is blocked.",
      "originalText": "Rule 1   Both governed workspaces:  allow Lakehouse, Data pipeline, Notebook\nRule 2   Data Engineering + AI:  allow Data agent\nRule 3   Every workspace EXCEPT the two governed workspaces:  allow all item types\n\nAn item can be created if ANY rule allows it. Anything no rule allows is blocked.",
